{"id":"1815a40148c6b14c67de4cc917130a5602a4be3a","url":"https://www.leiphone.com/category/yanxishe/31ByEdzxZC7DMqoR.html","title":"GLM 5.3 更强却更难用了？我们让它和 5.2 做了同一个北京城市驾驶游戏","site_name":"TopHub","source":"Readhub · AI","byline":null,"excerpt":"官方强调 GLM 5.3 安全能力大幅提升，实测却发现这套安全机制在自动化工具链中频繁触发拒绝，导致开发流程中断。","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div>\n                                                <!-- 123 -->\n                        \n                        \n                                                \n                        <!-- AI影响因子 -->\n                        <!-- xhBPeYDbNuuRZkwy -->\n                                                <!-- AI影响因子 -->\n                        <!-- 正文内容 -->\n                        <section data-mpa-action-id=\"mmiwq6ij1i3r\" data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img alt=\"GLM 5.3 更强却更难用了？我们让它和 5.2 做了同一个北京城市驾驶游戏\" data-src=\"https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20260901/6a968ecc57a78.jpg\" data-ratio=\"0.55\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"jpeg\" data-w=\"1000\" data-croporisrc=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/XqAicMdcoiafN0Fp1ibqHXkCno4ibbFMicEFAIT2EXxpSkakCQnic2feRO93HogjcSqQGJKSibpwyJqia38GAPiapjLu6zmFofj2qSY5C4JKrN47mBDo/0?wx_fmt=jpeg&from=appmsg\" data-cropselx1=\"0\" data-cropselx2=\"546\" data-cropsely1=\"0\" data-cropsely2=\"307\" data-imgfileid=\"100258759\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20260901/6a968ecc57a78.jpg?imageMogr2/quality/90\"></section><section data-pm-slice=\"5 10 []\" data-mpa-action-id=\"mmix4tgk1t7p\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-data-temp-type=\"image\" mpa-data-temp-power-by=\"yiban.io\" data-mpa-template=\"t\" data-mid=\"\"><section><section><span><span data-mpa-action-id=\"mmix6wyl1l05\" data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">官方强调 GLM 5.3 安全能力大幅提升，实测却发现这套安全机制在自动化工具链中频繁触发拒绝，导致开发流程中断。</span></span></span></span></section><span data-mpa-action-id=\"mqgbkegzw9n\"></span><span data-mpa-action-id=\"mpmlbwxl8oz